  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Hagen Automation is a small, UK based company that develops and mannufactures cutting edge lubricants for cyclists, engineers, scientists, 3D printers and other niche applications.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">We have several unique products many of which use tungsten disulphide or other rare and expensive friction reducers to give our products an edge over more established brands.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Being a small company we are adaptable and can manufacture in far smaller amounts than bigger companies. We innovate constantly and introduce several new, unique products every year. We offer quality and exclusivity.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong>Affilliate Terms and Conditions:</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Minimum qualifying order value of &pound;10 - this is as we offer free postage in the UK.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Minimum payment amount &pound;50 - we carry balances over until the minimum payment threshold reached. This is to prevent both us and you being overwhelmed by admin.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Payments amounts are considered to include VAT if applicable - please let us know if you are VAT registered and VAT should apply to your payments.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Payments are made at the end of the month with a minimum delay of 45 days to allow for delivery and returns.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">To avoid customer dissapointment our website (and therefore our affilate program) does not ship to the EU. This is due to the number of returns encountered due to customs charges. Please keep this in mind.</p>",
